<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ca">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NEW HORIZONS - Les teves vacances inoblidables</title>
    <style>
        /* Estils generals */
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #fdfaf6;
            color: #333;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #39b1a1;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        header p {
            margin: 5px 0 0 0;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        /* Carrusel de fotos principal (Pàgina 1) */
        .carousel-container {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 1000px;
            height: 450px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        .carousel-slide {
            display: none;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .carousel-slide img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .active {
            display: block;
        }

        /* Fleches del document (Verdes grans) */
        .arrow {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            color: #4b968c;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: 0.3s;
            user-select: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .arrow:hover {
            background-color: #4b968c;
            color: white;
        }

        .arrow-left { left: 20px; }
        .arrow-right { right: 20px; }

        /* Intro i Botons de Categoria */
        .intro-text {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            margin: 30px 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .season-selector {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .season-btn {
            background-color: white;
            border: 2px solid #39b1a1;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            width: 200px;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        }

        .season-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 15px rgba(57, 177, 161, 0.2);
        }

        .season-btn img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 120px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .season-btn span {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: #4b968c;
            display: block;
        }

        /* Seccions de contingut (Estiu / Hivern) */
        .season-section {
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            display: none;
        }

        .season-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #39b1a1;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #f0f0f0;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .grid-options {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: #fafafa;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #eaeaea;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }

        .card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 180px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .card-content {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .card-content h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #4b968c;
        }

        .card-content p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #555;
        }

        .btn-prices {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #58cebe;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 10px;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-prices:hover {
            background-color: #39b1a1;
        }

        /* --- ESTILS DEL WIDGET DEL XATBOT --- */
        #chatbot-widget {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            width: 300px;
            max-height: 400px;
            background-color: white;
            border: 1px solid #4b968c;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow: hidden;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            z-index: 9999;
        }

        #chat-header {
            background-color: #39b1a1;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        #chat-body {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 10px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .message {
            margin: 5px 0;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            max-width: 85%;
        }

        .user {
            text-align: right;
            color: white;
            background-color: #4b968c;
            margin-left: auto;
        }

        .bot {
            text-align: left;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        #chat-input {
            display: flex;
            border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
        }

        #chat-input input {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 10px;
            border: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            outline: none;
        }

        #chat-input button {
            padding: 10px;
            background-color: #39b1a1;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        #chat-toggle {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            background-color: #4b968c;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            font-size: 30px;
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 9998;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>NEW HORIZONS</h1>
        <p>Les teves vacances inoblidables!!!</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        
        <div class="carousel-container">
            <div class="carousel-slide active">
                <img src="imagen1.jpg" alt="Imatge de portada 1">
            </div>
            <div class="carousel-slide">
                <img src="imagen2.jpg" alt="Imatge de portada 2">
            </div>
            <div class="carousel-slide">
                <img src="imagen3.jpg" alt="Imatge de portada 3">
            </div>
            
            <button class="arrow arrow-left" onclick="plusSlides(-1)">←</button>
            <button class="arrow arrow-right" onclick="plusSlides(1)">→</button>
        </div>

        <div class="intro-text">
            En aquesta web tenim viatges preparats per especialistes en turisme, tenim diferents opcions de viatges, les més populars són: viatges a l'estiu i viatges a l'hivern, de platja i de muntanya. Esperem t'agradin!!!
